---
source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Environment
  INK_DIR            The site's folder, as -C
  INK_COLOR          auto, always or never, as --color
  INK_NO_PROGRESS    Log lines only, as --no-progress
  INK_LOG            The log filter, as --log; RUST_LOG is not read
  INK_LOG_FILE       Also write the log as JSON lines here, as --log-file
  INK_LOG_FORMAT     pretty, compact or json, on stderr
  INK_LOG_SPANS      none, open, close or full
  INK_LOG_TIMINGS    1 prints the span timing table at the end
  NO_COLOR           Set and not empty: no colour
  CLICOLOR_FORCE     Set and not 0: colour even to a pipe
  INK_COMPONENTS     The folder the build script reads components from
  INK_API            The address of the API, as --api
  INK_SITE           The site's id, as --site
  INK_KEY            The private key to sign requests with, for a CI job; never
                     a flag, so it stays out of process lists. `ink login` keeps
                     one in the config folder instead
  INK_KEY_FILE       A file that holds that key, in place of INK_KEY
  INK_SMTP_PASSWORD  The SMTP password for --mail smtp; never a flag, so it
                     stays out of process lists. Every other sign-in setting is
                     a flag with its own INK_ variable
